#### 10.2 비밀번호 해싱 예시

**bcrypt (Node.js)**:
```javascript
const bcrypt = require('bcrypt');
const saltRounds = 10;

// 해싱
const hashedPassword = await bcrypt.hash('SecureP@ssw0rd', saltRounds);
// 결과: $2b$10$abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz...

// 검증
const isMatch = await bcrypt.compare('SecureP@ssw0rd', hashedPassword);
// true
```

