NOTE BLOCK CONTENT:

#### 5.1 Breakpoints (브레이크포인트)

**일반적인 Breakpoints**:
- **Mobile**: 0 ~ 767px (Small)
- **Tablet**: 768px ~ 1023px (Medium)
- **Desktop**: 1024px ~ 1439px (Large)
- **Desktop XL**: 1440px+ (Extra Large)

**설정 예시 (CSS)**:
```css
/* Mobile First */
.container {
  padding: 16px;
}

/* Tablet */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .container {
    padding: 24px;
  }
}

/* Desktop */
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .container {
    padding: 32px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
}
```

